  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest fast food restaurant lying along the route toward Planet Word, Washington, DC from Mario & Alberto De La Cruz Art Gallery, Washington, DC?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.070132 38.906035)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.029302 38.902228)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.070132 38.906035)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.070132 38.906035)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
